{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1555599-created-heirs","id":1555599,"title":"Created Heirs","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-11-18T12:26:37-08:00","id":1555599,"title":"Created Heirs","content":"So, I've been reading the Dragon Companion, and one thing that stood out to me, especially in the &quot;create your own flight&quot; chapter, was the mention of Created and Chosen Heirs. Does anyone know what this is referring to? Since to my understanding the only two different Heir types are those empowered by a living dragon, and those inheriting the memories of a dead one. And neither seems to match with the context of chosen vs created.<br /> <br /> Also, as an aside, but Vishnap reincarnated? Was this in a Tasty Bit or something, or maybe a Dragon starter adventure? Or is this actually just being dropped on us now with the Returned?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28973-kenod","name":"kenod","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-08T21:47:53-08:00","id":1557398,"title":"","content":"It's probably a reference to the core book of Scion.<br /> <br /> Remember, Dragon is a supplement / spin off game that's set in the same universe.<br /> <br /> To put it simply, 1st edition of Scion required that your character be directly descended by blood to a deity in order to awaken as a Scion. You could also be adopted by a different deity, but you still needed divine blood in your lineage. But in 2nd edition, this was changed to there being a variety of options.<br /> <br /> One such being the Created, which are people who were spontaneously brought into existence through divine power. They could have been sculpted out of clay, bloomed from a cabbage patch, hatched from a stone egg, whatever.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Chosen are another alternative option, in that they were just regular mortals. Completely ordinary people, who drew the attention of a divine patron that decided to endow them with powers beyond their wildest dreams.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":29009,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","user":"DarkKing","date":". 01-09-2026, 12:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","name":"DarkKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29009_1.png","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-10T08:21:03-08:00","id":1557451,"title":"","content":"Created heirs is an idea with mythological roots. When I was in grade school and reading Edith Hamilton's book on the Greek myths(on this forum having been a kid that read several grade levels ahead of your age is normal) I read about a mortal fisherman who was turned into a sea god. I was reading about a created heir decades before the first edition of this game. <br /> <br /> The first version of the Chinese deities made turning mortals and ghosts into gods a function of purview. <br /> <br /> If you want created heirs, do it, the myths did it first.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-10T18:33:09-08:00","id":1557458,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1555599-created-heirs?p=1557451#post1557451\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Created heirs is an idea with mythological roots. When I was in grade school and reading Edith Hamilton's book on the Greek myths(on this forum having been a kid that read several grade levels ahead of your age is normal) I read about a mortal fisherman who was turned into a sea god. I was reading about a created heir decades before the first edition of this game.<br /> <br /> The first version of the Chinese deities made turning mortals and ghosts into gods a function of purview.<br /> <br /> If you want created heirs, do it, the myths did it first.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That sounds more like a Chosen, than a Created.<br /> <br /> Chosen are mortals who were bestowed the spark of divinity by a divine patron.<br /> <br /> Created are Scions who were spontaneously brought into existence through supernatural means. Such as Zeus sculpting a woman out of clouds, or Sun Wukong hatching out of a stone egg.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","name":"DarkKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29009_1.png","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-11T15:11:33-08:00","id":1557481,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DarkKing</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1555599-created-heirs?p=1557458#post1557458\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> That sounds more like a Chosen, than a Created.<br /> <br /> Chosen are mortals who were bestowed the spark of divinity by a divine patron.<br /> <br /> Created are Scions who were spontaneously brought into existence through supernatural means. Such as Zeus sculpting a woman out of clouds, or Sun Wukong hatching out of a stone egg.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well you don't need to follow one path anyway. Do what fits. If you decided that Athena and Hermes decided to turn your character into a god on a bet, go for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-13T12:45:55-08:00","id":1557557,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DarkKing</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1555599-created-heirs?p=1557398#post1557398\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's probably a reference to the core book of Scion.<br /> <br /> Remember, Dragon is a supplement / spin off game that's set in the same universe.<br /> <br /> To put it simply, 1st edition of Scion required that your character be directly descended by blood to a deity in order to awaken as a Scion. You could also be adopted by a different deity, but you still needed divine blood in your lineage. But in 2nd edition, this was changed to there being a variety of options.<br /> <br /> One such being the Created, which are people who were spontaneously brought into existence through divine power. They could have been sculpted out of clay, bloomed from a cabbage patch, hatched from a stone egg, whatever.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Chosen are another alternative option, in that they were just regular mortals. Completely ordinary people, who drew the attention of a divine patron that decided to endow them with powers beyond their wildest dreams.</div> </div> </div> </div>The thing is, Heirs in the Dragon sense, according to that book, are specifically supposed to be different. It always purely talks about Heirs in the term of people being chosen as them, with said people being descended from Dragons a very long time ago.<br /> <br /> I have no issue with the idea that Dragons can create new beings and make them Heirs (honestly, I don't really like how the core book only lets you have Chosen-type heirs in the first place), but there's nowhere in the Companion or the core Dragon book explaining the terms, so I'm trying to figure out if it's indeed as you said, with them suddenly implying it's possible, or some sort of edit oversight where I either don't have the correct version of the book, or it was something that they planned to explain but forgot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28973-kenod","name":"kenod","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-13T15:51:53-08:00","id":1557563,"title":"","content":"The terms are defined in <b>Scion: Hero</b>, pp.17\u201320. The recently released <b>Scion: God Player's Guide</b> adds a fifth type: Simply Divine (the character was a God from the start). So there are five: <br /> <br /> 1. Born. One of your parents is a God. <br /> 2. Chosen. Both of your parents are mortals, but a God empowered you. <br /> 3. Created. You have no parents; someone made you. <br /> 4. Incarnate. You used to be a God, but died. Now you're starting over. <br /> 5. Simply Divine. Both of your parents are Gods, and you've never been anything else.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 01-13-2026, 07:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-13T17:19:23-08:00","id":1557566,"title":"","content":"So...<br /> <br /> 1) Hercules <br /> <br /> 2) Captain Marvel (Billy Batson)<br /> <br /> 3) Wonder Woman from the 1940s until a few years ago.<br /> <br /> 4) No pop culture reference...yet.<br /> <br /> 5) Hermes","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-13T18:51:41-08:00","id":1557573,"title":"","content":"The redefining of Wonder Woman's origin has been undone; she's back to having been created.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-14T03:37:29-08:00","id":1557586,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1555599-created-heirs?p=1557573#post1557573\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The redefining of Wonder Woman's origin has been undone; she's back to having been created.</div> </div> </div> </div>Good to know. Number four has probably been done either in the <b>Sandman </b>or <b>Books of Magic</b> comic books, I've just forgotten it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-14T11:20:03-08:00","id":1557606,"title":"","content":"4 is basically a whole bunch of individuals from Hindu myth. Not quite pop-culture, but it's probably where the concept came from, possibly together with Dionysus, who also has a myth about dying, being reborn, and then going on a journey before coming back and establishing himself as a god.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28973-kenod","name":"kenod","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-14T12:03:33-08:00","id":1557610,"title":"","content":"Getting back to the original point, Heirs are defined by Inheritance; and they develop by recovering Memories of what they used to be. There's a strong implication that Inheritance is something you get when you come into existence, making it an awkward fit for the Chosen. The only way I could see that working would be something kind of like how One For All was passed on in My Hero Academia: when an ordinary mortal gets chosen by a Dragon, the Dragon somehow <i>implants </i>the Inheritance in the new Heir.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-14T12:40:41-08:00","id":1557613,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1555599-created-heirs?p=1557563#post1557563\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">5. Simply Divine. Both of your parents are Gods, and you've never been anything else.</div> </div> </div> </div>I take it that one is from either Demigod or God? I don't have either of those books, and I don't see it in Hero / Origin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","name":"DarkKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29009_1.png","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-14T13:21:57-08:00","id":1557616,"title":"","content":"It's from the God Player's Guide.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-14T19:52:31-08:00","id":1557629,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1555599-created-heirs?p=1557616#post1557616\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's from the God Player's Guide.</div> </div> </div> </div>That one just came out recently, right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","name":"DarkKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29009_1.png","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-14T20:47:38-08:00","id":1557631,"title":"","content":"Right. Last week, as I write this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user"